{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23394","headline":"和微之诗二十三首 和朝回与王链师游南山下 · 白居易","name":"和微之诗二十三首 和朝回与王链师游南山下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔼蔼春景余，峨峨夏云初。\n躞蹀退朝骑，飘颻随风裾。\n晨从四丞相，入拜白玉除。\n暮与一道士，出寻青谿居。\n吏隐本齐致，朝野孰云殊。\n道在有中适，机忘无外虞。\n但媿烟霄上，鸾凤爲吾徒。\n又慙云林间，鸥鹤不我疎。\n坐倾数杯酒，卧枕一卷书。\n兴酣头兀兀，睡觉心于于。\n以此送日月，问师爲何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}